{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/blockWiggle.gif?t=1745259713\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breakout Season is a chaotic, ball-bouncing roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim with precision to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682370?t=1745259713","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682370?t=1745259713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/0ca174b9a20eb2b984d3f3533d05fcbb2a15d651/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745259713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/0ca174b9a20eb2b984d3f3533d05fcbb2a15d651/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745259713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/blockWiggle.gif?t=1745259713\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breakout Season is a chaotic, ball-bouncing roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim with precision to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p>","developers":["Kakaos Collective"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/7a8d0dcf8694a4da2b34dfbb3cc5518685641b2a/header.jpg?t=1745259713","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Breakout Season","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Kakaos Collective"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/2e90c12417bb267a8861b32fedd1f370f409ef42/ss_2e90c12417bb267a8861b32fedd1f370f409ef42.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745259713","path_thumbnail